 "description": "An architectural achievement, the Lagoon 42 is a reference offering ease of handling, and reliability.  With over 1,000 catamarans built, she is the world’s best-selling catamaran!  To continue this adventure, Lagoon is launching the Millennium Lagoon 42.",
