 "press_quotes": [
  {
   "quote": "With the 42, the ergonomics have progressed further, notably due to the successful integration of a central helm station and mast.  She clearly demonstrates improved performance.  In fact, when sailing under spinnaker in gusty conditions (...), she glides with an incredibly smooth passage through the water.",
   "source": "MULTICOQUES MAGAZINE"
  },
  {
   "quote": "More than 800 Lagoon 42s have now been delivered, with the model proving equally popular with private and charter owners. It offers lots of space, even by multihull standards, in three- or four-cabin layouts.",
   "source": "YACHTING MONTHLY"
  },
  {
   "quote": "On the interior, a large L-shaped sofa serves as seating at the chart table/helm station. This is a good point, since having an ensemble of navigation equipment here enables you to check your course and to act at the helm via remote control from the interior.",
   "source": "BAND OF BOATS"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The perfectly equipped U-shaped galley, featuring wide countertops and numerous storage compartments, is turned toward the exterior cockpit.  Lastly, the saloon is generously proportioned and bright, and the view of the sea is exceptional.",
   "source": "MERS & BATEAUX"
  },
  {
   "quote": "Within the Lagoon range, the Lagoon 42 is a distinctive catamaran, as it has been the best-selling catamaran in the world since its launch, with nearly 1,000 units on the water.",
   "source": "ACTU NAUTIQUE"
  }
 ]
}
